	(text "FE1.1S configuration (datasheet Rev. B12.6E, pin table pp. 8-10):\n- BUSJ = 3.3V: report SELF-POWERED, so the host does not cap cameras at 100 mA\n- VBUSM = 3.3V: hub is powered only from host VBUS, so 'host present' is implicit\n- OVCJ = 3.3V: no over-current sensing; PWRJ (port power switch) unused\n- DRV pulled low at reset: normal hub (charging mode off); LED1/LED2 unused\n- TESTJ open (internal pull-up); XRSTJ pulled up, internal power-on reset\n- XIN/XOUT: internal load caps and feedback resistor, crystal 12 MHz 20 pF\n- REXT: 2.7k 1% to VSS; port 4 unused"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "47e6f088-7f53-4ff4-9594-d77559aebd42")
	)
	(text "Port map: 1 = CAM1 (J2), 2 = CAM2 (J3), 3 = IMU (J1), 4 unused.\nCamera/IMU pin order: 1 VBUS, 2 D-, 3 D+, 4 GND (J1 matches hub_imu J1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19b7de0e-c8fe-4d1e-8700-c91d54cbba60")
	)
	(text "Host cable: J4/J7 1.7 mm holes for 16-18 AWG power, J5/J6 0.65 mm holes for data."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e1aa7b0-576e-422a-9f31-9c1e0c67f7e7")
	)
